WEBVTT

00:00:07.492 --> 00:00:14.301
Now the front outline: new sketch on the YZ plane

00:00:14.301 --> 00:00:24.141
Polyline round the four corners of the mesh outline: bottom left, bottom right, top right, top left, back to bottom left (y −48 to 70, z 120 to 248)

00:00:24.141 --> 00:00:33.341
Traced lines have no constraints and would drift when we add radii. Select the bottom-left point and Lock it; lock the top-right point too

00:00:33.341 --> 00:00:40.894
The two top corners are cast fillets: Fillet tool, click the top-left corner point, then the top-right one

00:00:40.894 --> 00:00:52.036
Constrain both arcs to radius 14: select an arc, Radius, type 14

00:00:52.036 --> 00:00:58.120
The front outline is done: a rectangle with rounded top corners
